---
import { ArrowUpRight, SlidersHorizontal } from 'lucide-react';
---
<div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
  <a href="/tools/stripe-calculator" class="group">
    <div class="project-visual flex items-center justify-center p-8 sm:p-14"><div class="w-full max-w-xs rounded-2xl bg-card p-6 shadow-xl shadow-black/5 -rotate-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-muted-foreground"><span>Payment, simplified</span><SlidersHorizontal size={16} /></div><p class="mt-8 text-xs text-muted-foreground">You charge</p><p class="mt-2 text-4xl font-medium tracking-tighter">$1,000<span class="text-xl text-muted-foreground">.00</span></p><div class="my-6 border-t"></div><div class="flex justify-between text-sm"><span class="text-muted-foreground">You receive</span><span class="font-semibold text-secondary-foreground">$954.76</span></div><div class="mt-5 rounded-lg bg-secondary px-4 py-3 text-center text-xs text-secondary-foreground">Clear numbers. Better decisions.</div></div></div>
    <div class="mt-5 flex justify-between gap-4"><div><h3 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight">The everyday toolbox</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Practical calculators, considered down to the cent.</p></div><ArrowUpRight size={20} strokeWidth={1.5} /></div><p class="mt-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground">React / TypeScript / Finance</p>
  </a>
  <a href="/projects/objects-of-curiosity" class="group"><div class="project-visual flex items-center justify-center"><img src="/sculpture.png" alt="Silver intertwined sculpture from the Objects of curiosity experiment" width="720" height="720" loading="lazy" class="h-full w-full object-contain p-6" /><span class="absolute bottom-5 left-6 text-xs text-muted-foreground">An experiment in form & light</span><span class="absolute right-6 top-5 rounded-full border border-border bg-background/60 px-3 py-1 text-xs">Interactive</span></div><div class="mt-5 flex justify-between gap-4"><div><h3 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight">Objects of curiosity</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">A small exploration of a three-dimensional web.</p></div><ArrowUpRight size={20} strokeWidth={1.5} /></div><p class="mt-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground">Three.js / WebGL / GSAP</p></a>
</div>
